---
config:
  htmlLabels: false
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    background: "#ffffff"
    primaryColor: "#e3f2fd"
    primaryBorderColor: "#90caf9"
    primaryTextColor: "#1a1a1a"
    lineColor: "#546e7a"
    edgeLabelBackground: "#ffffff"
    clusterBkg: "#f5f5f5"
    clusterBorder: "#bdbdbd"
    secondaryColor: "#e8f5e9"
    tertiaryColor: "#f5f5f5"
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant CLI as xoos CLI
    participant Loader as Config Loader
    participant Executor as Executor (AWS/GCP)
    participant Storage as S3 / GCS
    participant Batch as AWS Batch / GCP Batch
    participant Driver as Driver Container
    participant NF as Nextflow
    participant Workers as Worker Tasks

    User->>CLI: xoos run --env aws_batch_bfx_ngs --pipeline-script .../main.nf ...
    CLI->>Loader: resolve_env_config_path("aws_batch_bfx_ngs")
    Loader-->>CLI: AwsBatchConfig
    CLI->>Executor: submit(RunContext)
    Executor->>Storage: Upload configs + driver script
    Executor->>Batch: Submit driver job to driver queue
    Batch->>Driver: Start container (nextflow/nextflow image)
    Driver->>Storage: Download configs
    Driver->>Driver: Restore .nextflow state (for -resume)
    Driver->>NF: Run nextflow command
    NF->>Workers: Submit tasks to worker queues
    Workers->>Storage: Read inputs, write outputs
    NF-->>Driver: Pipeline completes
    Driver->>Storage: Upload logs + .nextflow state
    Driver-->>Batch: Exit
